Native helper SHA256: 03c7b842def96ded3a132e8e602b3662684ca5a36c2fa614a9b331faa982466e
LOCAL DISABLED PROPOSAL. Review exact enable/deadline pins before installation.
Initial navigation requires exactly one bfl_f06p_run=f06p-integrated-v1 and one
bfl_f06p_role=A or B. These public markers select input only, never authority.
Keep the same document/controller through cleanup; no fallback or reset.
